    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.\u2606.\uff61+:\uff9f+\uff61.\uff9f\uff65.\u2606.:\u30fb\u00b0.\uff65\uff9f\u3000.\uff9f\uff65.\u2606\uff61\u30fb\u00b0.\uff65\uff9f\uff9f\uff65.\u2606.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pastel\u2606Parade is an exhilarating rhythm game with easy controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a comfortable rhythm to the cute and poppy music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are very intuitive: just press the buttons with the right timing according to the song's beat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >//////////////////////////////////////////////////////</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb5 30 groovy original songs!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy Pastel\u2606Parade's catchy, cute, and unique songs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of them can be quite challenging! Each play session only lasts about a minute, so you can try your hand at the songs as many times as you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f Fun gameplay! Four bright, poppy characters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your rhythm influences how the characters in the game move! Their animations are lots of fun whether you can keep the beat or not!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to a rhythm adventure with them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd6 A little story too...?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, its story is revealed little by little.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is divided into four areas, each with a different atmosphere. How far can you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >//////////////////////////////////////////////////////</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join this fun parade with its cute characters! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685840/extras/f04a9455a7bd17ca0c00b64fde2191d4.avif?t=1755263394\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.\u2606.\uff61+:\uff9f+\uff61.\uff9f\uff65.\u2606.:\u30fb\u00b0.\uff65\uff9f\u3000.\uff9f\uff65.\u2606\uff61\u30fb\u00b0.\uff65\uff9f\uff9f\uff65.\u2606. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Director / Programming / Animation - Matsu Friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art - bone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Design - FALL, MasaDo, Tsuyomi, MiwoTsukushi, Akane Aomo, AMANUMA Takayuki, YMAC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Permissions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please feel free to stream this game. When streaming, please include the title of this game and this URL in your video.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.\u2606.\uff61+:\uff9f+\uff61.\uff9f\uff65.\u2606.:\u30fb\u00b0.\uff65\uff9f\u3000.\uff9f\uff65.\u2606\uff61\u30fb\u00b0.\uff65\uff9f\uff9f\uff65.\u2606.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pastel\u2606Parade is an exhilarating rhythm game with easy controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a comfortable rhythm to the cute and poppy music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are very intuitive: just press the buttons with the right timing according to the song's beat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >//////////////////////////////////////////////////////</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb5 30 groovy original songs!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy Pastel\u2606Parade's catchy, cute, and unique songs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of them can be quite challenging! Each play session only lasts about a minute, so you can try your hand at the songs as many times as you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f Fun gameplay! Four bright, poppy characters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your rhythm influences how the characters in the game move! Their animations are lots of fun whether you can keep the beat or not!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to a rhythm adventure with them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd6 A little story too...?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, its story is revealed little by little.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is divided into four areas, each with a different atmosphere. How far can you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >//////////////////////////////////////////////////////</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join this fun parade with its cute characters! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685840/extras/f04a9455a7bd17ca0c00b64fde2191d4.avif?t=1755263394\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.\u2606.\uff61+:\uff9f+\uff61.\uff9f\uff65.\u2606.:\u30fb\u00b0.\uff65\uff9f\u3000.\uff9f\uff65.\u2606\uff61\u30fb\u00b0.\uff65\uff9f\uff9f\uff65.\u2606. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Director / Programming / Animation - Matsu Friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art - bone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Design - FALL, MasaDo, Tsuyomi, MiwoTsukushi, Akane Aomo, AMANUMA Takayuki, YMAC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Permissions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please feel free to stream this game. When streaming, please include the title of this game and this URL in your video.</p>",
